{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bnpg7F1ydh4RFDro5LubJ1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-16-0030-hoist-mle-trace-ctx-construction\n2\t\n3\tHoist the per-trace `TraceCtx` construction (including `main_ptrs.to_device()` uploads) out of the MLE round loop in `prove_zerocheck_and_logup_gpu`. Currently, each MLE round reconstructs `early_eval` and `late_eval` vectors from scratch, performing ~300 `to_device()` calls per round at APC 300 to upload pointer arrays that don't change between rounds. With 14 rounds × 2 segments = 28 iterations, this creates ~8,400 redundant allocation+upload cycles. Hoisting the `TraceCtx` construction before the MLE loop and reusing the device pointer buffers across rounds eliminates this per-round overhead.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a571e85-6b00-4234-bebc-3f2ef985c0ac","uuid":"1021c25d-4c38-49bc-a76d-af5c2fce19b6","timestamp":"2026-04-15T23:22:04.603Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-16-0030-hoist-mle-trace-ctx-construction\n\nHoist the per-trace `TraceCtx` construction (including `main_ptrs.to_device()` uploads) out of the MLE round loop in `prove_zerocheck_and_logup_gpu`. Currently, each MLE round reconstructs `early_eval` and `late_eval` vectors from scratch, performing ~300 `to_device()` calls per round at APC 300 to upload pointer arrays that don't change between rounds. With 14 rounds × 2 segments = 28 iterations, this creates ~8,400 redundant allocation+upload cycles. Hoisting the `TraceCtx` construction before the MLE loop and reusing the device pointer buffers across rounds eliminates this per-round overhead.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
